  "notes": "MIC/LINE 1 is an XLR/6.35 mm combo jack (mic or line); INST 2 is a 6.35 mm jack for instruments. Midas design preamp. USB bus-powered. Routing: inputs reach the outputs only with DIRECT MONITOR switched on. Controls from the U-PHORIA Quick Start Guide, 'Step 2: Controls'. Inputs reach the outputs and headphones only with DIRECT MONITOR on. The guide names no separate headphone level control for this model. Assumption: OUTPUT at MIN is silent; the +48 V switch powers the XLR input (MIC/LINE 1).",
